"entity": {
"name": "Indian Renewable Energy Development Agency Ltd.",
"description": "Indian Renewable Energy Development Agency Ltd. is a non-banking financial company, which engages in the promotion, development, and extending financial assistance for energy conservation projects. It operates through the following segments: Financing activities in the Renewable Energy and Energy Efficiency sector and Generation of Power through Solar Plant operations. The company was founded on March 11, 1987 and is headquartered in New Delhi, India.",
